  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧もてなす.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{客|きゃく}→客：00865_kyaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧もてなす (to entertain guests)\n- ⟦{手料理|てりょうり}→手料理：12760_teryouri⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧もてなす (to treat with home cooking)\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{込|こ}めて→込める：01945_komeru⟧もてなす (to host wholeheartedly)\n- ⟦{温|あたた}かく→温かい：13395_atatakai⟧もてなす (to give a warm welcome)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\nThe noun form ⟦おもてなし→おもてなし：16856_omotenashi⟧ is widely known from the phrase 「⟦おもてなし→おもてなし：16856_omotenashi⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧」 (the spirit of hospitality). ⟦おもてなし→おもてなし：16856_omotenashi⟧ became internationally known through the 2013 Tokyo Olympics bid presentation.",
